# Full public URL of the site, ending with "/".
# Used for the canonical link and the Facebook share image (og:image),
# which Facebook requires to be an absolute URL.
#
# You normally don't edit this: the GitHub Actions workflow overrides it
# with https://YOUR_USERNAME.github.io/REPO_NAME/ on every deploy.
# If you move to a custom domain, set it in the workflow (see README).
VITE_SITE_URL=/
